# Project core

- Product: Namma MedMate backend (`MED0001_Core`). Requirements live in `docs/requirements/INDEX.md`.
- Base path `/api/v1`. Success/error envelopes from INDEX. UUID v4 IDs. ISO-8601 UTC timestamps. Soft delete via `deleted_at`. Money in paise via `platform/kernel` `Money`.
- Layout: `apps/` composition roots, `platform/` technical shared, `domains/` epic-aligned, `db/migration/` sole Flyway tree.
- Before adding files, read `docs/architecture/MODULE_MAP.md`.
- Day-to-day: root `Makefile` + Podman (`make help`, `make up`, `make check`).
- Never invent a new top-level module. Never commit Terraform state/locks (S3 only).
- Ponytail applies for simplicity; 100% JaCoCo and security are explicit requirements — do not skip tests or trust-boundary validation.
- Agent/skill/command index: `AGENTS.md`.
